{
  "job_B23.3.2.3_20251003_114605": {
    "text": "Gif mann bi\u00f0 akenned on anre nihte ealne monan, se bi\u00f0 lang lifes & welig.\nGyf he bi\u00f0 on tweigra nihta akenned, se bi\u00f0 a seoc & unhal.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on \u00fereora nihta, se leofa\u00f0 lange.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on IIII nihta akenned, se bi\u00f0 a in wordum.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on V nihta adl on geogo\u00f0e gewite\u00f0.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on VI nihta adlig se bi\u00f0 lang lifes & ges\u00e6lig.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on VII nihta, se bi\u00f0 a weor\u00f0 & lyfa\u00f0 lange.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on VIII nihta eald, se swelte\u00f0 sona.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on IX nihta, se bi\u00f0 frecenlice akenned.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on X nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00ferowere.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XI nihta, se bi\u00f0 landes ofergenga.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XII nihta eald, se bi\u00f0 on eallum \u00feingum wur\u00f0full.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XIII o\u00f0\u00f0e on XIIII nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00e6ww\u00e6st & rihtwis.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XV nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gefaren.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XVI nihta, se bi\u00f0 on eallum \u00feingum nytwur\u00f0e.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XVII nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gewitan.\nGif hif he on XVIII nihta o\u00f0\u00f0e on XIX, se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XX nihta, se bi\u00f0 sona gefaren.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXI nihta, so bi\u00f0 on godre weor\u00feunge.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXII nihta, se bi\u00f0 unearh fihtling.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXIII nihta, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeofscea\u00f0a.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXIIII nihta, se bi\u00f0 geswincfull on his life.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXV nihta, se bi\u00f0 gehealtsum his lifes.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXVI nihta, se bi\u00f0 weoreces g\u00e6lsa.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on XXVII nihta, se bi\u00f0 to frecnum \u00feingum akenned.",
